Package: dmsggoligo
Title: DMS Golden Gate Oligo Pool Design Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Robert", "Chen", email = "robchen@uw.edu",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Design oligonucleotide pools for Deep Mutational Scanning (DMS)
    via three-enzyme Golden Gate Assembly. Generates all single amino acid
    substitutions with programmed barcodes, WT gene blocks, and QC reports.
